<title>USA: Tel-Save Holdings Inc Q3 net income rises.</title>
<headline>Tel-Save Holdings Inc Q3 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW HOPE, Pa. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>3 Mos ended 9/30     9 Mos ended 9/30</p>
<p>				  1996    1995	1996	1995</p>
<p> Revenues		  $60,079 $48,366   $168,159 $129,711</p>
<p> Net income		  7,032   2,519(A)  14,467    7,972(A)</p>
<p> Net EPS - Primary	   .22     .16(A)     .53	.51(A)</p>
<p> Wgtd shrs - Primary    31,699  15,928     27,269   15,567</p>
<p> Net EPS - Diluted	   .22     .16(A)     .52	.51(A)</p>
<p> Wgtd shrs - Diluted    32,370  15,937     28,089   15,581</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>(A) Pro forma tax provisions have been calculated as if results of operations were taxable as a C corporation (the company's current tax status) for the three and nine months ended September 30, 1995.</p>
<p>Prior to September 20, 1995, the company was an S corporation with all earnings taxed directly to its shareholders.</p>
</text>
